  "title": "GitLab CI: Don't build OpenSUSE 15.6 RPMs",
  "description": "It's going out of support on April 30, 2026. There's a SP7\nof SUSE Enterprise 15, but it would still require using the newer\nRuby on that to download updated asciidoctor manually. So it\ncan be done, but probably not worth it on CI at this point.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
